<item><title>Moroccan tomato exports push European prices down to €1.10 per kilogram</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/moroccan-tomato-exports-push-european-prices-down-to-1-10-98603d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/moroccan-tomato-exports-push-european-prices-down-to-1-10-98603d/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>Prices fell from €1.80 to €2 per kilogram as slower sales pressured traders to discount their produce.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:31:29 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Morocco plans annual imports of 30,000 cows to rebuild herds</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-plans-annual-imports-of-30-000-cows-to-rebuild-herds-9d0e2b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-plans-annual-imports-of-30-000-cows-to-rebuild-herds-9d0e2b/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>Agriculture Minister Khalid Hatimy said the six-year programme would also support local breeding and investment in feedlots and dairy production.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:05:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-plans-annual-imports-of-30-000-cows-to-rebuild-herds-9d0e2b/share.jpg" length="41404" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-plans-annual-imports-of-30-000-cows-to-rebuild-herds-9d0e2b/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
