<item><title>Morocco&apos;s king pledges continued role in Middle East peace efforts</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-s-king-pledges-continued-role-in-middle-east-peace-4bbd38/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-s-king-pledges-continued-role-in-middle-east-peace-4bbd38/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>King Mohammed VI renewed Morocco&apos;s support for a two-state settlement in a message to the UN committee chair, while saying the Gaza ceasefire has fallen short of expectations.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:59:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
